    Assertion:a-body-reads-its,sentence:a body reads its Post off the grant — the MyCave pier confers Cave the MyCaptain pier confers Captain and the Post is never a string the body picks but the invite feature projected
    Assertion:a-capability-is-not,sentence:a capability is not a Post — a Music grant confers no role so serving music and being a body stay distinct kinds of grant
  step=5,dige:8d118e416fbb132b
    Assertion:a-notgrant-drops-the,sentence:a NotGrant drops the Post but keeps the body — re-deriving after the revoke retires the role while the body row still stands so a Post-less body is undivided not deleted
